OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow Airport warns third
OL,4,Arunway could be delayed by four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeathrow Airport has warned that its
OL,7,Fplanned third runway might be delayed
OL,8,Fby four years due to planning and
OL,9,Fregulatory issues.
OL,11,FThe government had hoped the new runway
OL,12,Fat the UK's busiest airport, estimated
OL,13,Fto cost #49bn, would open by 2035.
OL,15,FBut Heathrow sees this deadline as
OL,16,Fincreasingly difficult to deliver
OL,17,Fwithout further steps to simplify the
OL,18,Fplanning process. It said on Saturday
OL,19,Fthat it hoped to secure planning
OL,20,Fpermission by 2029 and then open the
OL,21,Frunway "within a decade".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
